## GET /api/stock/{ticker}/flow-alerts

Flow Alerts

Deprecated. Use `/api/option-trades/flow-alerts`, which supports the full filter set:
[https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs#/operations/PublicApi.OptionTradeController.flow_alerts](https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs#/operations/PublicApi.OptionTradeController.flow_alerts)


